  "result": "I fixed three bugs, and the March total changed. `npm test` passes, 14 of 14. Please check the new total against the processor's statement.\n\nThe total went from 1136754.40 EUR to 1219033.19 EUR.\n\n- **Commas in big amounts:** `\"1,030.08\"` was read as 1 (`src/amount.mjs`). This lost the most money.\n- **Refunds in brackets:** `\"(15.90)\"` means minus 15.90. These 52 rows were thrown out as unreadable. They now count as refunds.\n- **Missing NOK rates:** NOK had no rate from 2026-03-17 to 2026-03-20. The code only looked back 2 days, then used a rate of 1. That counted NOK about 11 times too high. Now it uses the last earlier rate, as the README says (`src/fx.mjs`).\n\nI added tests for each bug. I also refreshed the saved March numbers in `test/golden/march.json`. Nothing is committed yet.",
